usage: castform [-h] [--profile PROFILE] <command> ...

Castform CLI

positional arguments:
  <command>
    login            Sign in via your browser
    logout           Clear cached session(s)
    whoami           Show the current login
    profile          Inspect Castform profiles
    config           Inspect Castform config
    runs             Inspect training runs
    stop             Stop (cancel) a run you own
    validate         Verify an env on a real-rollout subset; show rewards +
                     errors
    launch           Validate, upload, and launch a training run
    data             Dataset utilities
    corpus           Corpus utilities for RAG envs
    setup            Sign in + scaffold this project for a coding agent
    doctor           Check interpreter, sign-in, and env deps are ready
    guide            Walk through your first run
    help             List the available commands

options:
  -h, --help         show this help message and exit
  --profile PROFILE  Castform profile to use for this command
